triage: fix_tests: The failures come from scripted moves for seats the rules never ask to act, or for cards a seat may not hold. In round 13 seat 1 withdraws, so seat 2 correctly never acts. In round 8 seat 2 withdraws first, so seat 1 correctly never acts. The game is behaving as the rules require.
