triage: revise_rules: The game works as built, but one option dominates: always Fight (the first option) wins every decided match and always Withdraw loses every one. Withdrawing only hands the opponent VP and protects nothing, and a withdraw poll every battle round lets anyone who never withdraws farm points from an opponent who sometimes does.

